# Normalise line endings. Authored on Windows, but the repository is public and
# the container it deploys to is Linux — without this, every file round-trips
# between CRLF and LF and diffs fill with noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The licence is a verbatim legal document fetched from gnu.org. Leave its bytes
# alone so it stays diffable against the canonical text.
LICENSE -text

# Binary assets: never try to normalise these.
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.onnx binary
